# Looking up while running west across 0650, where frames run late (fps ~47-55, the debug line's
# late count climbing), every frame recorded. The floor's fog used to be rebuilt 2 frames after the
# camera moved: right only for frames on time, so here it was a frame out and a band of the circuit
# floor showed unfogged under the horizon as the look began (the user, 2026-11-15: "the VDP2
# circuit floor clips up"). Now each frame's fog is shown with its own picture (game/floor_fade.h,
# floor_fade_tables). The flash check: a band there for a frame is a flash
record
boot_at 0660
wait_up
wait 1.5
keydown up
wait 0.6
flashes_from
keydown y
wait 0.12
shot lr_00
wait 0.12
shot lr_01
wait 0.12
shot lr_02
wait 0.6
keyup y
wait 0.12
shot lr_03
wait 0.12
shot lr_04
wait 0.5
keydown y
wait 0.5
keyup y
wait 0.5
flashes_to look_up_running
keyup up
